<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Password Reset Successful</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #eef1f6;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 16px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 480px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08);
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1e40af);
            padding: 32px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .icon span {
            display: block;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .body {
            padding: 36px 32px 32px;
        }

        h2 {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
            text-align: center;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cta-wrap {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 28px 0 8px;
        }

        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: #eef0f3;
            margin: 28px 0 18px;
        }

        .warning {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #b91c1c;
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 20px 32px 28px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            background: #fafbfc;
            border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="icon"><span>&#10003;</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="body">
                <h2>Password Reset Successful</h2>
                <p>Hello <%= name %>, your password has been changed successfully.</p>
                <p>You can now log in to your MediCore Healthcare System account using your new password.</p>

                <div class="cta-wrap">
                    <a href="#" class="cta">Log In to Your Account</a>
                </div>

                <div class="divider"></div>
                <div class="warning">
                    ⚠ If you did not make this change, please contact support immediately.
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> MediCore Healthcare System. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>